      "content": "hey so i was watching that new interview with [Celebrity Name] and i noticed something super weird. like her eyes didn't even blink at the same time, it was like one eye was lagging or something?? it looked totally unnatural. u an expert on this stuff, can u tell me if that's actually possible for a human to do or is that like a glitch?",
